# Packages published to https://apt.skymob.app — this file IS the promotion
# decision. Only what is named here is published, so cutting a release upstream
# never reaches customers on its own.
#
# Edit it with New-AptPromotion / Remove-AptPromotion (Promote.psm1), not by
# hand: the matching .deb files under pool/ have to move with it, and the
# publish workflow refuses a commit where the two disagree.
#
# Format: "<package> <version>", one per line. <version> must match a release
# tag in SkyMobDev/iot-edge — but the tag is named for the project that builds
# the package, not for the package. skprinter comes from skprinter-appliance-v*
# (skprinter-v* is the Windows build, which ships no .deb). Promote.psm1 holds
# the mapping; that is the only place the two names meet.
#
# Keep the previous version listed too: apt installs the newest by default,
# and the older one in the pool is what makes `apt install skbridge=<old>`
# work when a site has to go back.

skprinter 0.1.5
skbridge 0.1.41
skbridge 0.1.26
